(5655299, 822478, 103032, '<td valign="top">Having skimmed through the forums and looking over the thumbs and some images, I think this definitely meets the challenge.  The guy with the gun is clearly the subject and the image tells a compelling story (even w/o the title).  Good effort.  I think going B&amp;W enhances the "story".</td>', 'Having skimmed through the forums and looking over the thumbs and some images, I think this definitely meets the challenge.  The guy with the gun is clearly the subject and the image tells a compelling story (even w/o the title).  Good effort.  I think going B&W enhances the "story".', '2009-09-21 02:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655301, 821706, 103032, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge; the subject (both guy and knife) are out of focus.  Image has a compelling story.  However, something about this pic seems "off".  Can''t quite put my finger on it but the "sharpness" of the guys face/beard(?) seems odd.  Still a good challenge entry.</td>', 'Meets the challenge; the subject (both guy and knife) are out of focus.  Image has a compelling story.  However, something about this pic seems "off".  Can''t quite put my finger on it but the "sharpness" of the guys face/beard(?) seems odd.  Still a good challenge entry.', '2009-09-21 02:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655308, 821866, 103032, '<td valign="top">Seems like a lensbaby image.  Appears the person on the right is the main subject but I don''t see what''s "compelling" about the pic.  It may be too out of focused to see the compelling story of what the person is doing; is she(?) picking  something up  or sweeping?</td>', 'Seems like a lensbaby image.  Appears the person on the right is the main subject but I don''t see what''s "compelling" about the pic.  It may be too out of focused to see the compelling story of what the person is doing; is she(?) picking  something up  or sweeping?', '2009-09-21 02:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
