(5655320, 822431, 96574, '<td valign="top">great shot. a lot of feeling in the way you used the composition, color and OoF subject. 9</td>', 'great shot. a lot of feeling in the way you used the composition, color and OoF subject. 9', '2009-09-21 03:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655327, 821711, 103032, '<td valign="top">I''m having difficulty with this one.  Both the EOTech and the silhouette are just about the same size, both are out of focus.  Which one is the main subject of this image or are both the main subject?  As a suggestion to make this image stronger, maybe differentiate the EOTech or the silhouette by one being larger than the other (the larger assumed to be the main subject).  Looking at this longer, I''m thinking the silhouette is the main subject and the rifle (therefore the sighting system) is the just the tool to take care of the threat (silhouette).  If that''s the case, then perhaps position the camera back farther to make the EOTech less prominent in size and bringing the silhouette closer to make it more prominent???  Well for what its worth...   In any case, I like the concept for the challenge.</td>', 'I''m having difficulty with this one.  Both the EOTech and the silhouette are just about the same size, both are out of focus.  Which one is the main subject of this image or are both the main subject?  As a suggestion to make this image stronger, maybe differentiate the EOTech or the silhouette by one being larger than the other (the larger assumed to be the main subject).  Looking at this longer, I''m thinking the silhouette is the main subject and the rifle (therefore the sighting system) is the just the tool to take care of the threat (silhouette).  If that''s the case, then perhaps position the camera back farther to make the EOTech less prominent in size and bringing the silhouette closer to make it more prominent???  Well for what its worth...   In any case, I like the concept for the challenge.', '2009-09-21 03:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
