(5655588, 822134, 100393, '<td valign="top">I avoided the Lensbaby for this one because I felt that since the lens is all about selective focus and because that act of focussing is (for me) the very essence of its use, its applicability for this challenge would seem a little diminished. -every unfocussed element becomes a choice.<br/> <br/>However, the image is OK and I have scored according to that rather than favouring my own interpretation of the challenge. I think it''s a little low on the ''compelling'' scale so I''ve offered a 5.</td>', 'I avoided the Lensbaby for this one because I felt that since the lens is all about selective focus and because that act of focussing is (for me) the very essence of its use, its applicability for this challenge would seem a little diminished. -every unfocussed element becomes a choice. However, the image is OK and I have scored according to that rather than favouring my own interpretation of the challenge. I think it''s a little low on the ''compelling'' scale so I''ve offered a 5.', '2009-09-21 10:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655590, 822549, 100393, '<td valign="top">That distortion / shear look towards the top left of the frame is the sort of appearance I''ve had using a moving iPhone as a camera. I wonder if this is shot like that?</td>', 'That distortion / shear look towards the top left of the frame is the sort of appearance I''ve had using a moving iPhone as a camera. I wonder if this is shot like that?', '2009-09-21 10:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655592, 821866, 100393, '<td valign="top">I avoided the Lensbaby for this one because I felt that since the lens is all about selective focus and because that act of focussing is (for me) the very essence of its use, its applicability for this challenge would seem a little diminished. -every unfocussed element becomes a choice.<br/> <br/>However, the image is great and I have scored according to that rather than favouring my own interpretation of the challenge. I think it''s high on the ''compelling'' scale so I''ve offered a 7.</td>', 'I avoided the Lensbaby for this one because I felt that since the lens is all about selective focus and because that act of focussing is (for me) the very essence of its use, its applicability for this challenge would seem a little diminished. -every unfocussed element becomes a choice. However, the image is great and I have scored according to that rather than favouring my own interpretation of the challenge. I think it''s high on the ''compelling'' scale so I''ve offered a 7.', '2009-09-21 10:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655596, 822686, 100393, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.</td>', 'Fabulous.', '2009-09-21 10:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
