(5655603, 822272, 100393, '<td valign="top">I avoided the Lensbaby for this one because I felt that since the lens is all about selective focus and because that act of focussing is (for me) the very essence of its use, its applicability for this challenge would seem a little diminished. -every unfocussed element becomes a choice.<br/> <br/>However, your choice of selective focus is very clever and sufficiently obtuse to fulfil a ''missed criteria'': having said all that, I''m really only scoring on whether I find the use of blur / focus / lack of focus compelling - in this case I do. 7.</td>', 'I avoided the Lensbaby for this one because I felt that since the lens is all about selective focus and because that act of focussing is (for me) the very essence of its use, its applicability for this challenge would seem a little diminished. -every unfocussed element becomes a choice. However, your choice of selective focus is very clever and sufficiently obtuse to fulfil a ''missed criteria'': having said all that, I''m really only scoring on whether I find the use of blur / focus / lack of focus compelling - in this case I do. 7.', '2009-09-21 10:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655605, 821849, 100393, '<td valign="top">Perfect for this challenge, Utterly compelling. 10.</td>', 'Perfect for this challenge, Utterly compelling. 10.', '2009-09-21 10:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
