(5655609, 821910, 100393, '<td valign="top">I avoided the Lensbaby for this one because I felt that since the lens is all about selective focus and because that act of focussing is (for me) the very essence of its use, its applicability for this challenge would seem a little diminished. -every unfocussed element becomes a choice.<br/> <br/>However, the image is pretty good and I have scored according to that rather than favouring my own interpretation of the challenge. I think it''s pretty high on the ''compelling'' scale so I''ve offered a 6.</td>', 'I avoided the Lensbaby for this one because I felt that since the lens is all about selective focus and because that act of focussing is (for me) the very essence of its use, its applicability for this challenge would seem a little diminished. -every unfocussed element becomes a choice. However, the image is pretty good and I have scored according to that rather than favouring my own interpretation of the challenge. I think it''s pretty high on the ''compelling'' scale so I''ve offered a 6.', '2009-09-21 10:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
