(5655944, 822480, 57460, '<td valign="top">The blue sky contrasts wonderfully with the golden barley field.  I am not sure if I like the tilt, or dislike it - I can''t make up my mind.  But besides that, wonderfully done!</td>', 'The blue sky contrasts wonderfully with the golden barley field.  I am not sure if I like the tilt, or dislike it - I can''t make up my mind.  But besides that, wonderfully done!', '2009-09-21 15:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
