(5655992, 821881, 57460, '<td valign="top">To begin with, I am not sure which way I lean as to whether motion blur fits in with this challenge or not.  If it is used in conjunction with an OOF area, then I think it would be appropriate.  It this particular photo, the merry-go-round looks as though it would be in focus if it was stopped.   But since there are differing opinions on this topic, I am not going to allow my personal opinion of does motion blur = OOF affect my vote. <br/> <br/>So with that aside, I do like the way you used the blur - it is very creative.  What I am not that fond of is what appears to be a tilt, and the slightly in focus background on image left, but not on the right.  It feels very off balanced to me.  If you crop out the left, I think it would help add to the composition.  But besides that, great job!  This was a very interesting challenge to participate in and I think your choice of subject is very creative!<br/> <br/>BTW - This is all just my opinion - please take it with a grain of salt!  Most of the time, I dont know what I am talking about! :)</td>', 'To begin with, I am not sure which way I lean as to whether motion blur fits in with this challenge or not.  If it is used in conjunction with an OOF area, then I think it would be appropriate.  It this particular photo, the merry-go-round looks as though it would be in focus if it was stopped.   But since there are differing opinions on this topic, I am not going to allow my personal opinion of does motion blur = OOF affect my vote.  So with that aside, I do like the way you used the blur - it is very creative.  What I am not that fond of is what appears to be a tilt, and the slightly in focus background on image left, but not on the right.  It feels very off balanced to me.  If you crop out the left, I think it would help add to the composition.  But besides that, great job!  This was a very interesting challenge to participate in and I think your choice of subject is very creative! BTW - This is all just my opinion - please take it with a grain of salt!  Most of the time, I dont know what I am talking about! :)', '2009-09-21 15:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655998, 821910, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is interesting because I''m put in the awkward position of disagreeing with what you''ve chosen as the subject of the image the "Midway". Personally I don''t see it as being any point of interest (it''s pretty empty with almost no action)where the Ferris Wheel is far more interesting, between the two imho. It''s a good shot and well processed so it should do well. Good Luck!</td>', 'This is interesting because I''m put in the awkward position of disagreeing with what you''ve chosen as the subject of the image the "Midway". Personally I don''t see it as being any point of interest (it''s pretty empty with almost no action)where the Ferris Wheel is far more interesting, between the two imho. It''s a good shot and well processed so it should do well. Good Luck!', '2009-09-21 16:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656005, 822536, 57460, '<td valign="top">I like your take on this challenge - playing on the "missed focus" as the emotion of your photo.  But in the photo, it appears the focus is on the Scotch bottle, which appears intentional and appears to be the main subject of the photo, with the person being just the background (sort of like some stock photography, where an object is the primary focus and the person or people are in the OOF background, just to help personify the photo).  I am not sure which way was your intention, but that is my first impression on it.<br/> <br/>Besides that, good job!!!  I love your play on missed focus as an emotion!</td>', 'I like your take on this challenge - playing on the "missed focus" as the emotion of your photo.  But in the photo, it appears the focus is on the Scotch bottle, which appears intentional and appears to be the main subject of the photo, with the person being just the background (sort of like some stock photography, where an object is the primary focus and the person or people are in the OOF background, just to help personify the photo).  I am not sure which way was your intention, but that is my first impression on it. Besides that, good job!!!  I love your play on missed focus as an emotion!', '2009-09-21 16:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656011, 822263, 57460, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this appears to be more abstract extreme OOF, instead of something that portrays missed focus.  But the colors are lovely.  I am not very fond of the dark area in the lower right corner, but the orange and green are very beautiful!</td>', 'In my opinion, this appears to be more abstract extreme OOF, instead of something that portrays missed focus.  But the colors are lovely.  I am not very fond of the dark area in the lower right corner, but the orange and green are very beautiful!', '2009-09-21 16:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656018, 822642, 57460, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bokeh!  It looks like a painting!  I love the colors!  The only downfall I see is that it doesnt seem to fully fit missed focus but more abstract OOF.  In my opinion, missed focus is just that  missed, not intentional OOF.  But there seems to be quite a few differing views on this while looking through the challenge entries.  So besides that, this is a beautiful photo!!!  Great job!</td>', 'Beautiful bokeh!  It looks like a painting!  I love the colors!  The only downfall I see is that it doesnt seem to fully fit missed focus but more abstract OOF.  In my opinion, missed focus is just that  missed, not intentional OOF.  But there seems to be quite a few differing views on this while looking through the challenge entries.  So besides that, this is a beautiful photo!!!  Great job!', '2009-09-21 16:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656024, 822549, 57460, '<td valign="top">I love the tone, and I think the photo fits the challenge topic well.  The only items I do not like are I think the background is a little busy, and it appears there is a bit of lens distortion on the left (possibly from a wide angle?)  But I do love the candid feel!  Great job!</td>', 'I love the tone, and I think the photo fits the challenge topic well.  The only items I do not like are I think the background is a little busy, and it appears there is a bit of lens distortion on the left (possibly from a wide angle?)  But I do love the candid feel!  Great job!', '2009-09-21 16:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656028, 821998, 57460, '<td valign="top">I think this photo fits the challenge topic very well!!!  Very much Missed focus!  Great composition, I love the B/W, and nice bokeh in the OOF areas.  Great job!!!</td>', 'I think this photo fits the challenge topic very well!!!  Very much Missed focus!  Great composition, I love the B/W, and nice bokeh in the OOF areas.  Great job!!!', '2009-09-21 16:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656034, 821721, 57460, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge topic very well.  I love the orange of the bird, but I am not sure I like the blue of the cage.  I wonder what this would look like with Blue desaturated.  I am not loving the angle, it appears a bit awkward, though I am sure you were trying to portray looking up.  I also think the dark lower right corner distracts from the rest of the photo a bit.  Other than that, great photo  and great fit to the challenge!</td>', 'This fits the challenge topic very well.  I love the orange of the bird, but I am not sure I like the blue of the cage.  I wonder what this would look like with Blue desaturated.  I am not loving the angle, it appears a bit awkward, though I am sure you were trying to portray looking up.  I also think the dark lower right corner distracts from the rest of the photo a bit.  Other than that, great photo  and great fit to the challenge!', '2009-09-21 16:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656063, 821998, 30982, '<td valign="top">A favorite use of missed focus for me - I love those little itty bitty details (the paw) backed by the OOF big picture.  This works for me.</td>', 'A favorite use of missed focus for me - I love those little itty bitty details (the paw) backed by the OOF big picture.  This works for me.', '2009-09-21 16:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656066, 822581, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is stunning - lovely work to capture form and light.</td>', 'This is stunning - lovely work to capture form and light.', '2009-09-21 16:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656071, 821898, 30982, '<td valign="top">Even though there''s a darkness to the center, the light around is inviting.  There''s a friendly feel to the shot, although the sense of motion can be a bit disconcerting if you visit for too long!</td>', 'Even though there''s a darkness to the center, the light around is inviting.  There''s a friendly feel to the shot, although the sense of motion can be a bit disconcerting if you visit for too long!', '2009-09-21 16:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656074, 822642, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good use of unfocus to accentuate form, color, contrast.  I find myself wanting more of the upper left side - I like the glow of the yellow there.</td>', 'A good use of unfocus to accentuate form, color, contrast.  I find myself wanting more of the upper left side - I like the glow of the yellow there.', '2009-09-21 16:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656080, 822440, 30982, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me smile - cute critters and they are nicely personified by the line and the title.  I do not, however, see this as missing focus since the bird looking at me seems well enough in focus.</td>', 'This shot makes me smile - cute critters and they are nicely personified by the line and the title.  I do not, however, see this as missing focus since the bird looking at me seems well enough in focus.', '2009-09-21 16:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656084, 822652, 30982, '<td valign="top">One could argue that your focus is exactly where it needs to be.  I''ll go with the fact that your choice of what to focus (ie not focusing on the obvious choice) is what makes this so effective.</td>', 'One could argue that your focus is exactly where it needs to be.  I''ll go with the fact that your choice of what to focus (ie not focusing on the obvious choice) is what makes this so effective.', '2009-09-21 16:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656086, 822580, 30982, '<td valign="top">This works for me.  I really like the crispness of it - clean, sharp color.  I suppose one could argue this misses the point of the challenge since you did manage to get focus on the cyclist pretty nicely, but like I said, it works for me.</td>', 'This works for me.  I really like the crispness of it - clean, sharp color.  I suppose one could argue this misses the point of the challenge since you did manage to get focus on the cyclist pretty nicely, but like I said, it works for me.', '2009-09-21 16:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656094, 822051, 33352, '<td valign="top">Now this to me is what this challenge is all about, the cow being the suject where the focus has been missed, and not an out of focus photo.......10+</td>', 'Now this to me is what this challenge is all about, the cow being the suject where the focus has been missed, and not an out of focus photo.......10+', '2009-09-21 16:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656148, 821866, 30982, '<td valign="top">This one works for me, and not just because I happen to really relate well to Lensbaby stuff.  Mostly because of the woman bending over.  The ATM is immaterial - it serves to light the scene.  The woman is what I want to see, and yet cannot.  Is it a bag she''s reaching to pick up?  An animal to pet?  The lack of crisp focus lets the story be what the user sees.  (edited for typos)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-28 04:00:19.</i></td>', 'This one works for me, and not just because I happen to really relate well to Lensbaby stuff.  Mostly because of the woman bending over.  The ATM is immaterial - it serves to light the scene.  The woman is what I want to see, and yet cannot.  Is it a bag she''s reaching to pick up?  An animal to pet?  The lack of crisp focus lets the story be what the user sees.  (edited for typos)', '2009-09-21 17:14:37.000000', '2009-09-28 05:00:19.000000', 1),
(5656150, 822553, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what they are, but they are very very cool!  Focus isn''t missed enough for the challenge in my mind simply because to me this is darn good focus.  :-)</td>', 'I don''t know what they are, but they are very very cool!  Focus isn''t missed enough for the challenge in my mind simply because to me this is darn good focus.  :-)', '2009-09-21 17:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656155, 821360, 30982, '<td valign="top">This SO reminds me of a picture of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50641" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">skewsme</a> from some time ago, but that''s the tree part, not the extracurricular part....  And it''s kinda cute...  :-)</td>', 'This SO reminds me of a picture of  skewsme from some time ago, but that''s the tree part, not the extracurricular part....  And it''s kinda cute...  :-)', '2009-09-21 17:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656157, 822614, 30982, '<td valign="top">This ought to win.  :-)  (Comment only.)</td>', 'This ought to win.  :-)  (Comment only.)', '2009-09-21 17:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656199, 821910, 57447, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge well and I like your choice of tone used.</td>', 'Fits challenge well and I like your choice of tone used.', '2009-09-21 17:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656202, 822459, 57447, '<td valign="top">Like the tone and composition used.</td>', 'Like the tone and composition used.', '2009-09-21 17:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656206, 822583, 57447, '<td valign="top">Dreamlike quality...I like it.</td>', 'Dreamlike quality...I like it.', '2009-09-21 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656209, 822328, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but it doesn''t look too out of focus to me.</td>', 'Nice shot but it doesn''t look too out of focus to me.', '2009-09-21 17:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656213, 822656, 57447, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a cat named Betty in my neighborhood.  I like it.</td>', 'Reminds me of a cat named Betty in my neighborhood.  I like it.', '2009-09-21 17:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656216, 821849, 57447, '<td valign="top">Dreamlike quality and nice tone.</td>', 'Dreamlike quality and nice tone.', '2009-09-21 17:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656217, 822171, 57447, '<td valign="top">Awesome.</td>', 'Awesome.', '2009-09-21 17:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656218, 822297, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice effect and aqua tone.</td>', 'Nice effect and aqua tone.', '2009-09-21 17:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656222, 821948, 52449, '<td valign="top">Bigfoot! He''s been spotted!!</td>', 'Bigfoot! He''s been spotted!!', '2009-09-21 17:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656229, 822646, 88533, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the blurred background turned out very good, but I think you would have gotten a much stronger shot if the lens/hand in the lower right corner were in focus. Maybe just my interpretation but I don''t believe that *everything* needs to be out of focus to meet this challenge. /6</td>', 'I like the composition and the blurred background turned out very good, but I think you would have gotten a much stronger shot if the lens/hand in the lower right corner were in focus. Maybe just my interpretation but I don''t believe that *everything* needs to be out of focus to meet this challenge. /6', '2009-09-21 17:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656241, 822601, 11854, '<td valign="top">Excellent! My only 10!</td>', 'Excellent! My only 10!', '2009-09-21 18:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656255, 822592, 108687, '<td valign="top">The composition doesn''t seem to work for this image. I would have liked it more had the angle been lower and more head-on.</td>', 'The composition doesn''t seem to work for this image. I would have liked it more had the angle been lower and more head-on.', '2009-09-21 18:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656256, 821721, 108687, '<td valign="top">Nice angle</td>', 'Nice angle', '2009-09-21 18:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656257, 822612, 108687, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture,</td>', 'Very nice capture,', '2009-09-21 18:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656258, 822580, 108687, '<td valign="top">Nice way to use the out of focus elements to capture motion. Well done.</td>', 'Nice way to use the out of focus elements to capture motion. Well done.', '2009-09-21 18:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656262, 822134, 108687, '<td valign="top">I like the distortion in this image.</td>', 'I like the distortion in this image.', '2009-09-21 18:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656263, 822639, 108687, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2009-09-21 18:20:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5656268, 822263, 108687, '<td valign="top">Just doesn''t work for me. Even with the strong colors the blur is too much.</td>', 'Just doesn''t work for me. Even with the strong colors the blur is too much.', '2009-09-21 18:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656298, 822431, 74588, '<td valign="top">this is poetry   10</td>', 'this is poetry   10', '2009-09-21 18:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656303, 822446, 74588, '<td valign="top">very strong    10</td>', 'very strong    10', '2009-09-21 18:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656305, 822687, 74588, '<td valign="top">got it all   10</td>', 'got it all   10', '2009-09-21 18:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656328, 821706, 50695, '<td valign="top">A mugger with a candle? Good use of blur, though.</td>', 'A mugger with a candle? Good use of blur, though.', '2009-09-21 19:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656330, 822555, 89341, '<td valign="top">OMG .... what were you thinking, do you even understand what missed focus means??? Out of focus is clearly not missed focus, how could you even think such a thing, you need missed out of focus blur tack sharpness whereas here you have focus blur missed out of tack sharpness .... back to the drawing board for you!! Ha ha, only joking!! I do quite like the abstractness and the splashes of colour though if I look at it too long my eyes start to bleed! I''d have guessed some kind of flowers from the colours but can''t really make anything out .... but then, that''s the point! I can see this selling for millions at the Tate ;)</td>', 'OMG .... what were you thinking, do you even understand what missed focus means??? Out of focus is clearly not missed focus, how could you even think such a thing, you need missed out of focus blur tack sharpness whereas here you have focus blur missed out of tack sharpness .... back to the drawing board for you!! Ha ha, only joking!! I do quite like the abstractness and the splashes of colour though if I look at it too long my eyes start to bleed! I''d have guessed some kind of flowers from the colours but can''t really make anything out .... but then, that''s the point! I can see this selling for millions at the Tate ;)', '2009-09-21 19:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656354, 821933, 92296, '<td valign="top">You''ll be posting the out takes?</td>', 'You''ll be posting the out takes?', '2009-09-21 19:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656366, 822297, 61651, '<td valign="top">Ethereal all the way through.  I sure hope this wins - it''s a beautiful example of the wonderful things you can do with defocusing.  Composition is stellar.</td>', 'Ethereal all the way through.  I sure hope this wins - it''s a beautiful example of the wonderful things you can do with defocusing.  Composition is stellar.', '2009-09-21 20:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656370, 822680, 61651, '<td valign="top">Graininess adds a lot to the mood here - very nicely done, to keep it so dark.</td>', 'Graininess adds a lot to the mood here - very nicely done, to keep it so dark.', '2009-09-21 20:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656373, 822603, 61651, '<td valign="top">It''s surprising to me how a simple change in technique can inject a bit of fresh air into a genre of photography that usually demands a very expected approach to it - I like what you did here.  My only quibble is I wish you hadn''t taken pains with your title to ward off misunderstanding - it makes the overall presentation a bit clunky (although my vote isn''t affected by this consideration).</td>', 'It''s surprising to me how a simple change in technique can inject a bit of fresh air into a genre of photography that usually demands a very expected approach to it - I like what you did here.  My only quibble is I wish you hadn''t taken pains with your title to ward off misunderstanding - it makes the overall presentation a bit clunky (although my vote isn''t affected by this consideration).', '2009-09-21 20:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656402, 822684, 94815, '<td valign="top">Off topic but nice image. This is motion blur not "missed" focus because the effect has nothing to do with focus.</td>', 'Off topic but nice image. This is motion blur not "missed" focus because the effect has nothing to do with focus.', '2009-09-21 20:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656411, 821427, 94815, '<td valign="top">Silly title - great shot.</td>', 'Silly title - great shot.', '2009-09-21 21:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656425, 821427, 27133, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  I love the OOF here.</td>', 'Very cute.  I love the OOF here.', '2009-09-21 21:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656426, 822603, 27133, '<td valign="top">Precious.  Well captured and controlled.</td>', 'Precious.  Well captured and controlled.', '2009-09-21 21:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656428, 821711, 27133, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of focus.  I would have thought the weapon should have been OOF.</td>', 'Interesting choice of focus.  I would have thought the weapon should have been OOF.', '2009-09-21 21:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656429, 822275, 27133, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what the white areas are meant to be...so I guess you fit the challenge.</td>', 'I am not sure what the white areas are meant to be...so I guess you fit the challenge.', '2009-09-21 21:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656430, 822593, 27133, '<td valign="top">I would have thought that the hand and foliage would have been the chosen subject to be in focus.  Nice image though.</td>', 'I would have thought that the hand and foliage would have been the chosen subject to be in focus.  Nice image though.', '2009-09-21 21:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
