(5656916, 821933, 27133, '<td valign="top">Ha...that''ll teach you.  Stare at the pretty girls and someone will always block your view!!!</td>', 'Ha...that''ll teach you.  Stare at the pretty girls and someone will always block your view!!!', '2009-09-22 05:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
