(5657030, 822478, 15711, '<td valign="top">a bit contrived, but I like how you incorporated the challenge idea and made it interesting. I like the diagonal sense of it.</td>', 'a bit contrived, but I like how you incorporated the challenge idea and made it interesting. I like the diagonal sense of it.', '2009-09-22 09:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657031, 822428, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. To me, the nature shots are the few in this challenge that are more than just a blurry mess.</td>', 'I like this a lot. To me, the nature shots are the few in this challenge that are more than just a blurry mess.', '2009-09-22 09:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657032, 822542, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m sure people are going to say "well the frog is the subject" but I have to disagree.  People automatically assume that the focused "thing" is the subject and that isn''t always the ase.  This is kinda cool, actually.</td>', 'I''m sure people are going to say "well the frog is the subject" but I have to disagree.  People automatically assume that the focused "thing" is the subject and that isn''t always the ase.  This is kinda cool, actually.', '2009-09-22 09:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657033, 822480, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but if the subject is that which should be blurred, shouldn''t you have titled it "the old house?"  Just a thought.  I like the tilt. 7</td>', 'I like this a lot, but if the subject is that which should be blurred, shouldn''t you have titled it "the old house?"  Just a thought.  I like the tilt. 7', '2009-09-22 09:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657034, 821933, 15711, '<td valign="top">Since the bird is in the title, that makes me think that is the subject, whereas if you called it "the girls of summer..."  does that make sense?  Not that it matters, just my take on it.</td>', 'Since the bird is in the title, that makes me think that is the subject, whereas if you called it "the girls of summer..."  does that make sense?  Not that it matters, just my take on it.', '2009-09-22 09:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657035, 822684, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh that is mega cool!!!!!</td>', 'Oh that is mega cool!!!!!', '2009-09-22 09:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
