(5657038, 822694, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t it have been more effective to have a true "subject" blurred, and not the entire photo?  Just a thought.  I like the colors and the linear vertical sense of the people.</td>', 'Wouldn''t it have been more effective to have a true "subject" blurred, and not the entire photo?  Just a thought.  I like the colors and the linear vertical sense of the people.', '2009-09-22 09:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
