(5657743, 822467, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think, if the girls had NOT been at the rule of thirds line, you would have a much better chance of convincing people your intention was to photograph the rose.  There is also too much else in focus to pull this off. 5 for attempting challenge.</td>', 'I think, if the girls had NOT been at the rule of thirds line, you would have a much better chance of convincing people your intention was to photograph the rose.  There is also too much else in focus to pull this off. 5 for attempting challenge.', '2009-09-22 18:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657746, 822458, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the lights and the darks but I really don''t get any kind of mood or emotion out of this image which it seems to require as it is not really about a thing.  Could be interesting if it wasn''t so split in half. 5 for attempt.</td>', 'I like the lights and the darks but I really don''t get any kind of mood or emotion out of this image which it seems to require as it is not really about a thing.  Could be interesting if it wasn''t so split in half. 5 for attempt.', '2009-09-22 18:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657748, 821605, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think your tones are good, but your blacks and whites are not that strong.  I rely on that because the subject itself gives me nothing to go on. 5</td>', 'I think your tones are good, but your blacks and whites are not that strong.  I rely on that because the subject itself gives me nothing to go on. 5', '2009-09-22 18:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657749, 821658, 34192, '<td valign="top">Way too much going on to pay attention to the bird.  It doesn''t seem to matter that it is out of focus.  It is also very centered with colors that seem lazy. 5 for attempt.</td>', 'Way too much going on to pay attention to the bird.  It doesn''t seem to matter that it is out of focus.  It is also very centered with colors that seem lazy. 5 for attempt.', '2009-09-22 18:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657838, 821360, 34192, '<td valign="top">the subject is mostly out of focus. but I don''t see anything compelling about it - the missed focus does not enhance the image in any way.  The subject itself is centered, drawing my attention (I give you credit for that) but it doesn''t provide any interest or tension to keep me engaged. The spiderweb at the bottom is more interesting, and I wonder where the spider went. 5</td>', 'the subject is mostly out of focus. but I don''t see anything compelling about it - the missed focus does not enhance the image in any way.  The subject itself is centered, drawing my attention (I give you credit for that) but it doesn''t provide any interest or tension to keep me engaged. The spiderweb at the bottom is more interesting, and I wonder where the spider went. 5', '2009-09-22 19:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657864, 822694, 34192, '<td valign="top">title makes me look for that which is alone.  Not finding it - everything is the same.  Since I can see no part of the photographer, I can''t believe he/she is the subject.  Interesting study, maybe in a series, maybe better in black and white, but not very effective standing on its own. 5</td>', 'title makes me look for that which is alone.  Not finding it - everything is the same.  Since I can see no part of the photographer, I can''t believe he/she is the subject.  Interesting study, maybe in a series, maybe better in black and white, but not very effective standing on its own. 5', '2009-09-22 20:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657887, 822592, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  I think this image could be improved by a change in point of view - instead of standing over the chickens, you could crouch down to their level.  then they would be backgrounded by the much more interesting tall grass, rather than the brown grass and cuttings.</td>', 'Hmmm.  I think this image could be improved by a change in point of view - instead of standing over the chickens, you could crouch down to their level.  then they would be backgrounded by the much more interesting tall grass, rather than the brown grass and cuttings.', '2009-09-22 20:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657910, 822182, 34192, '<td valign="top">No clue what the title means - for me, it doesn''t add.  Because the only white dog in the image is the only thing at the rule of thirds line, it would seem that it is the subject.  So I''m thinking, this image doesn''t really fit the challenge - the main subject is not out of focus.  Well taken though.</td>', 'No clue what the title means - for me, it doesn''t add.  Because the only white dog in the image is the only thing at the rule of thirds line, it would seem that it is the subject.  So I''m thinking, this image doesn''t really fit the challenge - the main subject is not out of focus.  Well taken though.', '2009-09-22 20:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657918, 821513, 34192, '<td valign="top">Like the action in this image but I think the background really detracts.  Its overly stark, overly white, and the whole image feels overexposed because of it. 6</td>', 'Like the action in this image but I think the background really detracts.  Its overly stark, overly white, and the whole image feels overexposed because of it. 6', '2009-09-22 20:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657920, 822171, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think, if this had more variance in tone, I might like it better.  Right now, the shapes provide nothing really.  Looks like it could be interesting with just more variation or a hue or two. 6</td>', 'I think, if this had more variance in tone, I might like it better.  Right now, the shapes provide nothing really.  Looks like it could be interesting with just more variation or a hue or two. 6', '2009-09-22 20:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657926, 822511, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think this works for the challenge.  I can''t really say I''m really interested beyond that (not very compelling). I wish there had been a slight curves adjustment to balance the lights and darks a little better. 6</td>', 'I think this works for the challenge.  I can''t really say I''m really interested beyond that (not very compelling). I wish there had been a slight curves adjustment to balance the lights and darks a little better. 6', '2009-09-22 20:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657935, 822590, 34192, '<td valign="top">The image holds no blacks or whites.  Could use a stiff curves adjustment - it just looks washed out.  I think the out of focus works here. 6</td>', 'The image holds no blacks or whites.  Could use a stiff curves adjustment - it just looks washed out.  I think the out of focus works here. 6', '2009-09-22 20:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657936, 822642, 34192, '<td valign="top">Late summer hues but you really only have 2 (barely a third).  Think this would work much better with more color and more blur.</td>', 'Late summer hues but you really only have 2 (barely a third).  Think this would work much better with more color and more blur.', '2009-09-22 20:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657943, 822263, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love the colors but I feel the image isn''t balanced - there is too much light with only a touch of dark.  Alternatively, you could go with light only and remove the black splotch altogether but as it is, it feel unsettled, and not in a good way.  I do think the blur works really well though. 6</td>', 'I love the colors but I feel the image isn''t balanced - there is too much light with only a touch of dark.  Alternatively, you could go with light only and remove the black splotch altogether but as it is, it feel unsettled, and not in a good way.  I do think the blur works really well though. 6', '2009-09-22 20:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657948, 822462, 34192, '<td valign="top">The image is titled foot and the foot is in focus.  So the foot is the subject?  If so, this does not meet the challenge.  I think, if the blur were a little stronger, the image might be a little more effective.</td>', 'The image is titled foot and the foot is in focus.  So the foot is the subject?  If so, this does not meet the challenge.  I think, if the blur were a little stronger, the image might be a little more effective.', '2009-09-22 20:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657957, 822333, 67152, '<td valign="top">i need to come back and look at this every once in a while</td>', 'i need to come back and look at this every once in a while', '2009-09-22 20:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657958, 822272, 67152, '<td valign="top">my favorite story in the whole challenge</td>', 'my favorite story in the whole challenge', '2009-09-22 20:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657959, 822275, 67152, '<td valign="top">very very very very cool - love it - 10</td>', 'very very very very cool - love it - 10', '2009-09-22 20:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657985, 822511, 97225, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot.</td>', 'Sweet shot.', '2009-09-22 21:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657986, 822492, 97225, '<td valign="top">Good shot. The oof spider gives it a sinister creepiness.</td>', 'Good shot. The oof spider gives it a sinister creepiness.', '2009-09-22 21:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657991, 822661, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice warm happy feeling of a leisurely stroll.</td>', 'Nice warm happy feeling of a leisurely stroll.', '2009-09-22 21:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657995, 822601, 97225, '<td valign="top">Very effective. Love the sparkly water.</td>', 'Very effective. Love the sparkly water.', '2009-09-22 21:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657996, 822580, 97225, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of composition and minimal detail which work well with the appropriately oof subject.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of composition and minimal detail which work well with the appropriately oof subject.', '2009-09-22 21:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5657997, 822542, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning image.</td>', 'This is a stunning image.', '2009-09-22 21:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658020, 822695, 34192, '<td valign="top">With a larger tonal range, this image could be more interesting.  Right now, it is just kind of dark and dreary.  I like the color palette though.</td>', 'With a larger tonal range, this image could be more interesting.  Right now, it is just kind of dark and dreary.  I like the color palette though.', '2009-09-22 21:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658024, 822468, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I like the colors and the use of light and dark but I also think your image is completely overwhelmed by the ''stuff'' surrounding the horse - there is too much clutter and its not interesting clutter.  meet challenge topic though.</td>', 'Interesting.  I like the colors and the use of light and dark but I also think your image is completely overwhelmed by the ''stuff'' surrounding the horse - there is too much clutter and its not interesting clutter.  meet challenge topic though.', '2009-09-22 21:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658051, 822690, 97225, '<td valign="top">Elegant composition.</td>', 'Elegant composition.', '2009-09-22 21:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658052, 822431, 97225, '<td valign="top">Very evocative.</td>', 'Very evocative.', '2009-09-22 21:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658053, 822263, 97225, '<td valign="top">Pretty colours make a nice abstract.</td>', 'Pretty colours make a nice abstract.', '2009-09-22 21:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658054, 822692, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is quite charming.</td>', 'This is quite charming.', '2009-09-22 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658056, 822603, 97225, '<td valign="top">Very charming study.</td>', 'Very charming study.', '2009-09-22 21:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658058, 822694, 97225, '<td valign="top">I quite like this. - especially the bright traffic lights.</td>', 'I quite like this. - especially the bright traffic lights.', '2009-09-22 21:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658060, 822684, 97225, '<td valign="top">Eerie!</td>', 'Eerie!', '2009-09-22 21:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658063, 821706, 97225, '<td valign="top">Quite effective, it reminds me of the Indiana Jones type movies.</td>', 'Quite effective, it reminds me of the Indiana Jones type movies.', '2009-09-22 22:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658065, 822531, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is rather nice.</td>', 'This is rather nice.', '2009-09-22 22:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658066, 821271, 97225, '<td valign="top">Rather pretty.</td>', 'Rather pretty.', '2009-09-22 22:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658070, 821513, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.', '2009-09-22 22:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658071, 822479, 97225, '<td valign="top">I think that this is beautiful and elegant, but barely out of focus.</td>', 'I think that this is beautiful and elegant, but barely out of focus.', '2009-09-22 22:07:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5658073, 822549, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, but it is only very barely out of focus.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, but it is only very barely out of focus.', '2009-09-22 22:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658074, 822637, 97225, '<td valign="top">The colours are really lovely.</td>', 'The colours are really lovely.', '2009-09-22 22:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658075, 822555, 97225, '<td valign="top">Quite an attractive abstract.</td>', 'Quite an attractive abstract.', '2009-09-22 22:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658079, 822592, 97225, '<td valign="top">The focus is only just a bit off.</td>', 'The focus is only just a bit off.', '2009-09-22 22:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658082, 822330, 97225, '<td valign="top">Although the man in the foreground is just slightly out of focus, my eye is drawn to the two men on the right, and therefore I see them as the subject. Because of that I don''t interpret this photo as a case of missed focus at all.</td>', 'Although the man in the foreground is just slightly out of focus, my eye is drawn to the two men on the right, and therefore I see them as the subject. Because of that I don''t interpret this photo as a case of missed focus at all.', '2009-09-22 22:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658086, 822571, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, but it doesn''t strike me as ''missed focus''.</td>', 'Beautiful image, but it doesn''t strike me as ''missed focus''.', '2009-09-22 22:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658087, 821526, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. It doesn''t really say ''missed focus'' to me.</td>', 'Nice shot. It doesn''t really say ''missed focus'' to me.', '2009-09-22 22:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658088, 822440, 97225, '<td valign="top">Quite a pretty shot, but it doesn''t really have any compelling use of missed focus.</td>', 'Quite a pretty shot, but it doesn''t really have any compelling use of missed focus.', '2009-09-22 22:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658090, 822612, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is just such a beautiful shot but it doesn''t really strike me as being ''missed focus''.</td>', 'This is just such a beautiful shot but it doesn''t really strike me as being ''missed focus''.', '2009-09-22 22:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658091, 822171, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is quite intriguing, and I''m glad I took a second look at it. (So should you be!)</td>', 'This is quite intriguing, and I''m glad I took a second look at it. (So should you be!)', '2009-09-22 22:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658093, 821849, 100831, '<td valign="top">love it!</td>', 'love it!', '2009-09-22 22:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658094, 821933, 103309, '<td valign="top">Answers the challenge perfectly...10</td>', 'Answers the challenge perfectly...10', '2009-09-22 22:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658095, 822642, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the consistency of texture and color</td>', 'I like the consistency of texture and color', '2009-09-22 22:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658097, 821271, 103309, '<td valign="top">would be a beautiful painting... 7</td>', 'would be a beautiful painting... 7', '2009-09-22 22:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658098, 822614, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the moody feel - great shapes - and the nice bright colors really work, but I''ll bet these contrasts would look equally well in b/w.</td>', 'I like the moody feel - great shapes - and the nice bright colors really work, but I''ll bet these contrasts would look equally well in b/w.', '2009-09-22 22:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658099, 822480, 103309, '<td valign="top">very nice...8</td>', 'very nice...8', '2009-09-22 22:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658100, 822455, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like this, particularly the bright red shirt but also the composition of muted shapes (and lines) behind it.</td>', 'Nicely done. I like this, particularly the bright red shirt but also the composition of muted shapes (and lines) behind it.', '2009-09-22 22:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658101, 822428, 103309, '<td valign="top">beautiful...9</td>', 'beautiful...9', '2009-09-22 22:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658103, 821527, 100831, '<td valign="top">Someone apparently has a sense of humor.... but I''m also liking the composition of this shot. Good one.</td>', 'Someone apparently has a sense of humor.... but I''m also liking the composition of this shot. Good one.', '2009-09-22 22:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658105, 822434, 100831, '<td valign="top">This is so abstract that I don''t know how to react so far as the challenge is concerned, but I am enjoying the photo too much to think about it.</td>', 'This is so abstract that I don''t know how to react so far as the challenge is concerned, but I am enjoying the photo too much to think about it.', '2009-09-22 22:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658106, 822682, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. Love the color. And great for the topic.</td>', 'Nicely composed. Love the color. And great for the topic.', '2009-09-22 22:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658117, 822474, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like how the ground birds are lined up and in the same position - they serve as a good echo to the lines of buildings in the background.  The bird in flight adds a nice element in the top third to balance things out.   Overall, a very relaxing image, well done.</td>', 'I like how the ground birds are lined up and in the same position - they serve as a good echo to the lines of buildings in the background.  The bird in flight adds a nice element in the top third to balance things out.   Overall, a very relaxing image, well done.', '2009-09-22 22:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658119, 822656, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very simple but also very effective, iconic.</td>', 'Very simple but also very effective, iconic.', '2009-09-22 22:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658121, 822646, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like this composition - one is free to imagine the foremost subject is just another view of the second subject, and the balloon behind is what the lens(es) represented here are pointing at.  I also like that you resisted putting anything fully in focus here.</td>', 'I like this composition - one is free to imagine the foremost subject is just another view of the second subject, and the balloon behind is what the lens(es) represented here are pointing at.  I also like that you resisted putting anything fully in focus here.', '2009-09-22 22:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658122, 822431, 61651, '<td valign="top">The abstraction really sets up the mood of isolation nicely.  Also the tilt accentuates the sense of a downward/negative progress, like the subject has a long, hard way ahead.</td>', 'The abstraction really sets up the mood of isolation nicely.  Also the tilt accentuates the sense of a downward/negative progress, like the subject has a long, hard way ahead.', '2009-09-22 23:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658126, 822614, 61651, '<td valign="top">Colors take center stage here, and the composition is good.  Nicely titled - the Green Fairy, indeed.</td>', 'Colors take center stage here, and the composition is good.  Nicely titled - the Green Fairy, indeed.', '2009-09-22 23:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658127, 822688, 61651, '<td valign="top">I find this dark and stormy image mesmerizing - through a window?  Well done.</td>', 'I find this dark and stormy image mesmerizing - through a window?  Well done.', '2009-09-22 23:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658142, 822684, 61651, '<td valign="top">I had a very similar thought (half seen/exposed subject), but not enough time to get my act together and do it - I''m glad to see someone else did.  You of course, put the technique to use to create a more compelling story than I ever could.  Perils of time travel - very clever.</td>', 'I had a very similar thought (half seen/exposed subject), but not enough time to get my act together and do it - I''m glad to see someone else did.  You of course, put the technique to use to create a more compelling story than I ever could.  Perils of time travel - very clever.', '2009-09-22 23:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658143, 822615, 61651, '<td valign="top">There appears to be so many layers here, very fascinating - I keep coming back for more looks.</td>', 'There appears to be so many layers here, very fascinating - I keep coming back for more looks.', '2009-09-22 23:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658144, 822478, 102534, '<td valign="top">LOL, Brilliant :)</td>', 'LOL, Brilliant :)', '2009-09-22 23:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658146, 822480, 61651, '<td valign="top">You could have named this "Christina''s world" and I would have believed it to be from her perspective.  <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christina%27s_World" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">linkie.</a>  Love the tilt.</td>', 'You could have named this "Christina''s world" and I would have believed it to be from her perspective.  linkie.  Love the tilt.', '2009-09-22 23:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658155, 822459, 61651, '<td valign="top">For some reason I think I see a collie dog wearing a bowler hat.  I can''t wait to see if I''m right!  Hope the 1-second voters aren''t hitting you too hard.</td>', 'For some reason I think I see a collie dog wearing a bowler hat.  I can''t wait to see if I''m right!  Hope the 1-second voters aren''t hitting you too hard.', '2009-09-22 23:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658247, 822680, 45475, '<td valign="top">Charming photograph with a classic feel. Love the rich blacks. I don''t think it would have worked nearly as well had you kept something in focus. Hope it''s doing well for you. Very deserving of praise and high marks :)</td>', 'Charming photograph with a classic feel. Love the rich blacks. I don''t think it would have worked nearly as well had you kept something in focus. Hope it''s doing well for you. Very deserving of praise and high marks :)', '2009-09-23 00:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658250, 822431, 45475, '<td valign="top">Riveting image. Thank you.</td>', 'Riveting image. Thank you.', '2009-09-23 00:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658253, 822601, 45475, '<td valign="top">Dazzling effect, great idea!</td>', 'Dazzling effect, great idea!', '2009-09-23 00:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658805, 822659, 67363, '<td valign="top">I think this image would have had more impact if the cat was in focus and the background not</td>', 'I think this image would have had more impact if the cat was in focus and the background not', '2009-09-23 08:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658806, 822695, 67363, '<td valign="top">I think you should have one flower in focus and the rest not</td>', 'I think you should have one flower in focus and the rest not', '2009-09-23 08:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658807, 821383, 67363, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I can''t see what it is</td>', 'Sorry, I can''t see what it is', '2009-09-23 08:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658808, 821513, 67363, '<td valign="top">I think the bird is a little too out of focus</td>', 'I think the bird is a little too out of focus', '2009-09-23 08:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658810, 822458, 67363, '<td valign="top">Would have been better to focus on one animal and the others be out of focus</td>', 'Would have been better to focus on one animal and the others be out of focus', '2009-09-23 08:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658812, 822274, 67363, '<td valign="top">nice and simple</td>', 'nice and simple', '2009-09-23 08:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659065, 821605, 109953, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2009-09-23 10:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659227, 822680, 57447, '<td valign="top">A like the depth, shadows and toning you used.  Good work.</td>', 'A like the depth, shadows and toning you used.  Good work.', '2009-09-23 12:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659229, 822661, 57447, '<td valign="top">I like the tone nad bokeh from the trees.  Nicely composed, a few highlights removed would have made it even better.</td>', 'I like the tone nad bokeh from the trees.  Nicely composed, a few highlights removed would have made it even better.', '2009-09-23 12:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659232, 822614, 57447, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge well.</td>', 'Fits challenge well.', '2009-09-23 12:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659308, 822690, 83313, '<td valign="top">Some heavy purple fringing makes this appear unnatural. Also, for an OOF subject, the edge of the bird against the sky is a fairly hard edge. It does not come off to me very well, I''m afraid.<br/> <br/>Edited for phat phingers. I hate when I misspell things.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-28 00:22:58.</i></td>', 'Some heavy purple fringing makes this appear unnatural. Also, for an OOF subject, the edge of the bird against the sky is a fairly hard edge. It does not come off to me very well, I''m afraid. Edited for phat phingers. I hate when I misspell things.', '2009-09-23 13:32:07.000000', '2009-09-28 01:22:58.000000', 1),
(5659313, 822447, 83313, '<td valign="top">Can I nitpick? The spelling of this meaning of the word is "preying". The praying mantis is preying on the spearmint. Sorry, I can get a little anal about these things. I hait it wen I mispel sumthing.<br/> <br/>Oh, and a sevvun for this piktur.</td>', 'Can I nitpick? The spelling of this meaning of the word is "preying". The praying mantis is preying on the spearmint. Sorry, I can get a little anal about these things. I hait it wen I mispel sumthing. Oh, and a sevvun for this piktur.', '2009-09-23 13:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659315, 821526, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see motion blur on the parakeet, but the focus on him is nice and sharp. I can''t see any way that the OOF background is intended as the subject.</td>', 'I see motion blur on the parakeet, but the focus on him is nice and sharp. I can''t see any way that the OOF background is intended as the subject.', '2009-09-23 13:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659317, 822661, 74588, '<td valign="top">what can i say?   7</td>', 'what can i say?   7', '2009-09-23 13:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659318, 822553, 83313, '<td valign="top">The missed focus seems artificially induced here. Objects both nearer and further away are more in focus than the unlit item. (Whatever the heck these are...) I like it, but the out of focus aspect comes across as unnatural.</td>', 'The missed focus seems artificially induced here. Objects both nearer and further away are more in focus than the unlit item. (Whatever the heck these are...) I like it, but the out of focus aspect comes across as unnatural.', '2009-09-23 13:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659319, 822550, 74588, '<td valign="top">aaaah this is a beauty   10</td>', 'aaaah this is a beauty   10', '2009-09-23 13:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659320, 822447, 74588, '<td valign="top">got it all    10</td>', 'got it all    10', '2009-09-23 13:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659321, 822177, 83313, '<td valign="top">Appears to perhaps be more motion blur than focus blur. If he has just flown off the rock, then he is at the same focal plane as the in-focus rock.</td>', 'Appears to perhaps be more motion blur than focus blur. If he has just flown off the rock, then he is at the same focal plane as the in-focus rock.', '2009-09-23 13:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
