(5662487, 822660, 68256, '<td valign="top">It seems like maybe a "tweener"...between abstract and concrete.  I think it would have worked better for me for this type of shot if the overall composition was cleaner.  I don''t mean more in focus,  I don''t really know how to explain it.</td>', 'It seems like maybe a "tweener"...between abstract and concrete.  I think it would have worked better for me for this type of shot if the overall composition was cleaner.  I don''t mean more in focus,  I don''t really know how to explain it.', '2009-09-25 19:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662489, 822134, 68256, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I think I would have liked it more if the tone of the photo matched to title more...more contrasty perhaps.  I like the blurred edges, but I don''t like the crane leading the eye out of the photo, perhaps a small black border would have helped.  Nice composition otherwise.</td>', 'Cool shot.  I think I would have liked it more if the tone of the photo matched to title more...more contrasty perhaps.  I like the blurred edges, but I don''t like the crane leading the eye out of the photo, perhaps a small black border would have helped.  Nice composition otherwise.', '2009-09-25 19:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662491, 822593, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, regardless of the challenge.  It would score higher in a "selective focus" challenge, so don''t feel bad if you are getting a lot of "looks focused to me" comments.  I love the warm tones and the composition.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, regardless of the challenge.  It would score higher in a "selective focus" challenge, so don''t feel bad if you are getting a lot of "looks focused to me" comments.  I love the warm tones and the composition.', '2009-09-25 19:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662495, 822661, 68256, '<td valign="top">You''ve met the challenge well, but the composition doesn''t work for me.  I think the killer for me is the blown highlights at the top and left side are just too much.  I love the blown highlights at the end of the road leading your eye down the road with the walkers.  I would love to see this shot reworked outside of the dpchallenge restrictions..darken the trees, clone out the sun spots (except at the end of the road...) would be an awesome composition.  I''m giving it an 8 for potential.</td>', 'You''ve met the challenge well, but the composition doesn''t work for me.  I think the killer for me is the blown highlights at the top and left side are just too much.  I love the blown highlights at the end of the road leading your eye down the road with the walkers.  I would love to see this shot reworked outside of the dpchallenge restrictions..darken the trees, clone out the sun spots (except at the end of the road...) would be an awesome composition.  I''m giving it an 8 for potential.', '2009-09-25 19:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662496, 822614, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is very nice, best so far that I''ve seen (of course I''ve only voted on 13 of the images!).  The earth tones and "dreaminess" are wonderful.  I have no idea what the title means, but I really like the photo.  10</td>', 'Wow, this is very nice, best so far that I''ve seen (of course I''ve only voted on 13 of the images!).  The earth tones and "dreaminess" are wonderful.  I have no idea what the title means, but I really like the photo.  10', '2009-09-25 19:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662497, 822136, 68256, '<td valign="top">Truly outstandingly missed focus, easily the best "rats I missed that one" of the group (so far anyway!).  I don''t know if it should be a 1 or a 10 so it must be perfect...10!</td>', 'Truly outstandingly missed focus, easily the best "rats I missed that one" of the group (so far anyway!).  I don''t know if it should be a 1 or a 10 so it must be perfect...10!', '2009-09-25 19:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662498, 822649, 68256, '<td valign="top">Classic thumb in front of camera LOL.  Even the thumb is oof.  I suppose this has to be a setup background but it definately meets the challenge.  Very creative!</td>', 'Classic thumb in front of camera LOL.  Even the thumb is oof.  I suppose this has to be a setup background but it definately meets the challenge.  Very creative!', '2009-09-25 19:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662500, 822590, 68256, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft focused shot...the tiny aperture huge dof almost messed the missed focus up for you though LOL.  I do kinda wish their was some darker blacks (closer to your border) in the photo itself.  It looks a little flat otherwise.</td>', 'Lovely soft focused shot...the tiny aperture huge dof almost messed the missed focus up for you though LOL.  I do kinda wish their was some darker blacks (closer to your border) in the photo itself.  It looks a little flat otherwise.', '2009-09-25 19:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662501, 822263, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract.  The composition is a little out of balance with the dark bottom right, but the colors are fantastic.  Great shot.</td>', 'Very nice abstract.  The composition is a little out of balance with the dark bottom right, but the colors are fantastic.  Great shot.', '2009-09-25 19:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662502, 822642, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice "painterly" photo.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice "painterly" photo.  Well done.', '2009-09-25 19:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662503, 822428, 68256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot...I''m actually a big fan of grass though so I don''t think you missed the focus at all!  I''ll give you a good score though because I supposed most people would want to see the falls.  Still I wouldn''t change a thing...nothing missed about it!</td>', 'Beautiful shot...I''m actually a big fan of grass though so I don''t think you missed the focus at all!  I''ll give you a good score though because I supposed most people would want to see the falls.  Still I wouldn''t change a thing...nothing missed about it!', '2009-09-25 19:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662504, 822542, 68256, '<td valign="top">Definitely not missed focus, I love this little subject.  I don''t have the heart to vote low for the little fellow though!</td>', 'Definitely not missed focus, I love this little subject.  I don''t have the heart to vote low for the little fellow though!', '2009-09-25 19:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662506, 822671, 68256, '<td valign="top">To me this one meets the challenge well as missed focus and - as an added bonus - it is interesting and beautiful. The only negative for me is the somewhat focused and distracting leaves.</td>', 'To me this one meets the challenge well as missed focus and - as an added bonus - it is interesting and beautiful. The only negative for me is the somewhat focused and distracting leaves.', '2009-09-25 19:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662507, 821427, 68256, '<td valign="top">Good one!  I know it has to be hard to submit these crazy shots, I hope your score is doing good, you deserve it.</td>', 'Good one!  I know it has to be hard to submit these crazy shots, I hope your score is doing good, you deserve it.', '2009-09-25 19:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662508, 822580, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great panning shot...I suppose in some communities people might think this is a missed focus, but I have a feeling here people are voteing down because for this type of shot it is very nicely sharp.  Good shot regardless.</td>', 'Great panning shot...I suppose in some communities people might think this is a missed focus, but I have a feeling here people are voteing down because for this type of shot it is very nicely sharp.  Good shot regardless.', '2009-09-25 19:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662509, 822690, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like the missed focus, but not the chromatic aberrations.</td>', 'I like the missed focus, but not the chromatic aberrations.', '2009-09-25 19:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662511, 822275, 68256, '<td valign="top">Thats what I''m talking about!  great missed focus shot.  I''m a huge fan of simplistic compositions and this one is perfect.  Love the bright lights pulling you back in after the center stripe leads you clean off the page.  Nice touch leaving it color too...really like this shot.</td>', 'Thats what I''m talking about!  great missed focus shot.  I''m a huge fan of simplistic compositions and this one is perfect.  Love the bright lights pulling you back in after the center stripe leads you clean off the page.  Nice touch leaving it color too...really like this shot.', '2009-09-25 19:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662513, 821706, 68256, '<td valign="top">Funny, he looks like a nice man...but then the knife?, candle, title and stare suggest otherwise.  regardless, I like the "non" focus, it adds to the composition which is the point of the challenge.</td>', 'Funny, he looks like a nice man...but then the knife?, candle, title and stare suggest otherwise.  regardless, I like the "non" focus, it adds to the composition which is the point of the challenge.', '2009-09-25 19:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662515, 822585, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the colors (especially in the background).  Actually the background colors really support the subject well.  It is odd that it is a little grainy though, I would like it better silky smooth (noise wise).  Put me down on the "not a fan of the frame" list too...(I''m sure your getting that alot).</td>', 'I love the colors (especially in the background).  Actually the background colors really support the subject well.  It is odd that it is a little grainy though, I would like it better silky smooth (noise wise).  Put me down on the "not a fan of the frame" list too...(I''m sure your getting that alot).', '2009-09-25 19:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662519, 822474, 68256, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I love the fact that you didn''t include what was actually focused on like some of the others...it makes it look more interesting (at least to me anyway).  Good job.</td>', 'Cool shot.  I love the fact that you didn''t include what was actually focused on like some of the others...it makes it look more interesting (at least to me anyway).  Good job.', '2009-09-25 19:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662520, 822688, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried so many times to capture a wind/rain storm in all its glory and have never gotten anything as beautiful as this.  I really really like it.</td>', 'I''ve tried so many times to capture a wind/rain storm in all its glory and have never gotten anything as beautiful as this.  I really really like it.', '2009-09-25 19:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662521, 822646, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great ummmm saturation :)  There is no reason to like this.  9.  :)</td>', 'Great ummmm saturation :)  There is no reason to like this.  9.  :)', '2009-09-25 19:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662523, 821721, 68256, '<td valign="top">I get that the bird should be in focus and not the cage, but the placement of the focus point (at a thirds intersection) combined with the fact that the bird is cut of suggests that the focus wasn''t missed at all.  It is hard for me to vote on these kind that meet the challenge but are composed "correctly".</td>', 'I get that the bird should be in focus and not the cage, but the placement of the focus point (at a thirds intersection) combined with the fact that the bird is cut of suggests that the focus wasn''t missed at all.  It is hard for me to vote on these kind that meet the challenge but are composed "correctly".', '2009-09-25 20:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662526, 822601, 68256, '<td valign="top">Bold!  I love it.  I''m amazed at this shot really.  I''m a big fan of b/w so would love to see this in black and white.  Can''t see giving this anything other than 10.</td>', 'Bold!  I love it.  I''m amazed at this shot really.  I''m a big fan of b/w so would love to see this in black and white.  Can''t see giving this anything other than 10.', '2009-09-25 20:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662527, 822686, 68256, '<td valign="top">So many times we try to brighten up the shadows to please dpchallenge voters and I must say thanks for not doing that here...love the dark moody dancers.  Great shot.</td>', 'So many times we try to brighten up the shadows to please dpchallenge voters and I must say thanks for not doing that here...love the dark moody dancers.  Great shot.', '2009-09-25 20:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662529, 822536, 68256, '<td valign="top">Now that is out of the box..shoehorn with purpose....I love it!</td>', 'Now that is out of the box..shoehorn with purpose....I love it!', '2009-09-25 20:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662531, 822592, 68256, '<td valign="top">While it certainly meets the challenge, the composition just doesn''t work for me.  It seems out of balance.</td>', 'While it certainly meets the challenge, the composition just doesn''t work for me.  It seems out of balance.', '2009-09-25 20:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662533, 822171, 68256, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  I really do like this oddly enough.  Well balanced and interesting.  Most of the time I say darken the darks and lighten the lights for b/w (s-curve tone), but this works perfectly as is.</td>', 'Fantastic!  I really do like this oddly enough.  Well balanced and interesting.  Most of the time I say darken the darks and lighten the lights for b/w (s-curve tone), but this works perfectly as is.', '2009-09-25 20:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662534, 822447, 68256, '<td valign="top">Love the earth tones and "interestingness" of this shot.  Very well done for such a strange challenge.</td>', 'Love the earth tones and "interestingness" of this shot.  Very well done for such a strange challenge.', '2009-09-25 20:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662536, 822589, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like this, but would have loved it if there were no green or dark corners...just cropped a little tighter so it was frame filled.</td>', 'I like this, but would have loved it if there were no green or dark corners...just cropped a little tighter so it was frame filled.', '2009-09-25 20:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662546, 822603, 68256, '<td valign="top">At first glance I didn''t "get" this, but once I did I really really like it.  I kinda wish there was some balance on the top left...either another face (a husbands?) or maybe if she were holding the flower up a little more.  Regardless this is an awesome story caught on camera. 10</td>', 'At first glance I didn''t "get" this, but once I did I really really like it.  I kinda wish there was some balance on the top left...either another face (a husbands?) or maybe if she were holding the flower up a little more.  Regardless this is an awesome story caught on camera. 10', '2009-09-25 20:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662547, 822519, 68256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture!  I really like the happy mood that you''ve created.</td>', 'Beautiful capture!  I really like the happy mood that you''ve created.', '2009-09-25 20:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662551, 822680, 68256, '<td valign="top">Love the mood you captured..great grain and choice of b/w.</td>', 'Love the mood you captured..great grain and choice of b/w.', '2009-09-25 20:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662553, 822405, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I bet the bride and groom love this one!  I know I would...</td>', 'Very nice!  I bet the bride and groom love this one!  I know I would...', '2009-09-25 20:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662555, 821632, 68256, '<td valign="top">Fun shot...and brave of you!  It took me a minute but I finally did make out the rooster.  Love the colors.</td>', 'Fun shot...and brave of you!  It took me a minute but I finally did make out the rooster.  Love the colors.', '2009-09-25 20:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662556, 822581, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wonderful work of art...very well balanced and I love the colors.  I''d be proud to hang this on my wall.</td>', 'Wonderful work of art...very well balanced and I love the colors.  I''d be proud to hang this on my wall.', '2009-09-25 20:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662557, 822002, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is some missed focus!  Love that colorful graffiti.</td>', 'Wow, that is some missed focus!  Love that colorful graffiti.', '2009-09-25 20:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662560, 822639, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  It almost looks liquid....love the brightness.</td>', 'Very nice!  It almost looks liquid....love the brightness.', '2009-09-25 20:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662561, 822297, 68256, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition!  I really like this and can see it on a wall...</td>', 'Lovely composition!  I really like this and can see it on a wall...', '2009-09-25 20:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662563, 822480, 68256, '<td valign="top">I actually prefer this focus...it really is a great shot. I don''t feel guilty at all voting high for this because subject is in the eye of the beholder right?  Perhaps someone would want the building in focus although they would be wrong :)</td>', 'I actually prefer this focus...it really is a great shot. I don''t feel guilty at all voting high for this because subject is in the eye of the beholder right?  Perhaps someone would want the building in focus although they would be wrong :)', '2009-09-25 20:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662565, 822612, 68256, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture!  Love how clean this composition is.  I also love the "flat" lighting, this one definately doesn''t need to be over saturated, curve adjusted to the max....it works perfectly as is.  10 stars.</td>', 'Awesome capture!  Love how clean this composition is.  I also love the "flat" lighting, this one definately doesn''t need to be over saturated, curve adjusted to the max....it works perfectly as is.  10 stars.', '2009-09-25 20:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662567, 822532, 68256, '<td valign="top">I actually like this quite a lot...it is balanced and interesting and the tones are wonderful.  Good choice.</td>', 'I actually like this quite a lot...it is balanced and interesting and the tones are wonderful.  Good choice.', '2009-09-25 20:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662569, 821849, 68256, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture!  I love that no detail is lost..perfectly exposed and perfectly processed.</td>', 'Amazing capture!  I love that no detail is lost..perfectly exposed and perfectly processed.', '2009-09-25 20:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662683, 822478, 56797, '<td valign="top">I Loooooove this! Very nicely done. I hope you do very well in the challenge. Good Luck!</td>', 'I Loooooove this! Very nicely done. I hope you do very well in the challenge. Good Luck!', '2009-09-25 22:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662695, 822468, 88247, '<td valign="top">"Oui,Oui"Belle!!<br/> <br/>Love this image you have created in this shot!!.<br/>Wonderful autumn colours.<br/> <br/>2-1 to me XX:-)</td>', '"Oui,Oui"Belle!! Love this image you have created in this shot!!.Wonderful autumn colours. 2-1 to me XX:-)', '2009-09-25 22:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662696, 822601, 83313, '<td valign="top">Watery goodness here, and I always love a bike shot.</td>', 'Watery goodness here, and I always love a bike shot.', '2009-09-25 22:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662700, 822479, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, with good lighting, though if the focus is off, it is only by a touch.</td>', 'Nicely done, with good lighting, though if the focus is off, it is only by a touch.', '2009-09-25 22:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662704, 822405, 83313, '<td valign="top">The title explains it nicely.</td>', 'The title explains it nicely.', '2009-09-25 22:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662776, 822468, 45475, '<td valign="top">[wags finger like a school teacher]<br/>See, this is what happens when you don''t run it past someone first. Psycho was infinitely better. What were you thinking?!<br/>[walks off, shaking head]</td>', '[wags finger like a school teacher]See, this is what happens when you don''t run it past someone first. Psycho was infinitely better. What were you thinking?![walks off, shaking head]', '2009-09-25 23:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662811, 822171, 53814, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Title is over my head. -10</td>', 'Excellent photo. Title is over my head. -10', '2009-09-26 00:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662941, 822639, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image and the title is very suited.</td>', 'Beautiful image and the title is very suited.', '2009-09-26 05:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662942, 822519, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely. A perfect choice of subject to have oof because this makes it all the more dreamy and enchanting.</td>', 'This is just lovely. A perfect choice of subject to have oof because this makes it all the more dreamy and enchanting.', '2009-09-26 05:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662943, 822446, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject. The lack of focus adds to the concept.</td>', 'Great choice of subject. The lack of focus adds to the concept.', '2009-09-26 05:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662944, 822581, 97225, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image - very suited to the oof treatment.</td>', 'A beautiful image - very suited to the oof treatment.', '2009-09-26 05:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662945, 821849, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, evocative image. One of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful, evocative image. One of the best in this challenge.', '2009-09-26 05:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662946, 822550, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image. The soft focus works well here.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image. The soft focus works well here.', '2009-09-26 05:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
