(5662948, 822638, 97225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image.</td>', 'Gorgeous image.', '2009-09-26 05:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662949, 822671, 97225, '<td valign="top">Very pretty image.</td>', 'Very pretty image.', '2009-09-26 05:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662950, 822333, 97225, '<td valign="top">Love the Duchamp feet. I think this meets the ''compelling'' requirement well.</td>', 'Love the Duchamp feet. I think this meets the ''compelling'' requirement well.', '2009-09-26 05:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663064, 822615, 110294, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I had to look at this one for a long time. Excellent choice.</td>', 'Interesting image. I had to look at this one for a long time. Excellent choice.', '2009-09-26 07:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663066, 822480, 110294, '<td valign="top">I like the comp, the lighting and point of view. Great work.</td>', 'I like the comp, the lighting and point of view. Great work.', '2009-09-26 07:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663067, 822542, 110294, '<td valign="top">Great work on this image. I like the DOF..</td>', 'Great work on this image. I like the DOF..', '2009-09-26 07:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663068, 822182, 110294, '<td valign="top">I do like the lighting and comp of this image. Very fun. Keep up the good work.<br/>df</td>', 'I do like the lighting and comp of this image. Very fun. Keep up the good work.df', '2009-09-26 07:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663069, 821933, 110294, '<td valign="top">Fun image. I like it.</td>', 'Fun image. I like it.', '2009-09-26 07:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663070, 821849, 110294, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. I like the mood of this image. The comp and lighting are wonderful as well.</td>', 'Excellent image. I like the mood of this image. The comp and lighting are wonderful as well.', '2009-09-26 07:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663071, 822639, 110294, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and this image has a wonderful dreamy mood to it.</td>', 'Excellent colors and this image has a wonderful dreamy mood to it.', '2009-09-26 07:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663163, 822660, 34192, '<td valign="top">The focus on the subject is missed, though I can''t say it is very compelling. 5</td>', 'The focus on the subject is missed, though I can''t say it is very compelling. 5', '2009-09-26 11:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663167, 822683, 34192, '<td valign="top">Even in focus I''m not sure this would be a compelling image - out of focus nothing is gained.</td>', 'Even in focus I''m not sure this would be a compelling image - out of focus nothing is gained.', '2009-09-26 11:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663170, 822646, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this, though I''m not sure the missed focus makes the image or the subject more compelling.  In fact, I''m not quite sure what the subject is. 6</td>', 'I like the composition of this, though I''m not sure the missed focus makes the image or the subject more compelling.  In fact, I''m not quite sure what the subject is. 6', '2009-09-26 11:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663173, 821383, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love this.  There is a sense of joie de vivre.  The missed focus works perfectly to make the subject compelling. probably one of the best in the challenge. Composition well done. 10</td>', 'I love this.  There is a sense of joie de vivre.  The missed focus works perfectly to make the subject compelling. probably one of the best in the challenge. Composition well done. 10', '2009-09-26 11:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663174, 822601, 34192, '<td valign="top">Not at all fond of the colors here.  But I really like the use of missed focus.  The title works with the image to promote the carefree feeling of the work.  well done 9</td>', 'Not at all fond of the colors here.  But I really like the use of missed focus.  The title works with the image to promote the carefree feeling of the work.  well done 9', '2009-09-26 11:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663197, 821849, 34192, '<td valign="top">Like this.  Like the tones used.  I have one similar.  Great mood.  I think the in focus foreground really adds a lot to the image.  So far,t he best I''ve seen with regard to being missed focus and being compelling.  And finally, a decent title.  9 may bump later. bumped to 10.</td>', 'Like this.  Like the tones used.  I have one similar.  Great mood.  I think the in focus foreground really adds a lot to the image.  So far,t he best I''ve seen with regard to being missed focus and being compelling.  And finally, a decent title.  9 may bump later. bumped to 10.', '2009-09-26 11:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663198, 822549, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Love the tones and I think your lines are spot on.  Excellent capture. 8 bumped to 9.  compelling. very compelling. I think it is the look on the girl''s face.</td>', 'Very cool.  Love the tones and I think your lines are spot on.  Excellent capture. 8 bumped to 9.  compelling. very compelling. I think it is the look on the girl''s face.', '2009-09-26 11:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663199, 822434, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I would like to see the right third cropped. It doesn''t add and really reduces the tension of having the three main spots.  Cropping it would also greatly increase the value of the two overlapping spots on the left.  Again, very cool and I think the title works. 8 bump to 9</td>', 'Very cool.  I would like to see the right third cropped. It doesn''t add and really reduces the tension of having the three main spots.  Cropping it would also greatly increase the value of the two overlapping spots on the left.  Again, very cool and I think the title works. 8 bump to 9', '2009-09-26 11:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663200, 822687, 34192, '<td valign="top">this image made me laugh.  thank you.  I have no doubt about what the subject is - the action and movement apparent in the image allows for no other subject.  Your use of timing with the lighting situation really helps because it limits your color palette to reduce any distraction.  Oh, and it looks like a girl. 8 bump to 9 because I enjoy it so much.</td>', 'this image made me laugh.  thank you.  I have no doubt about what the subject is - the action and movement apparent in the image allows for no other subject.  Your use of timing with the lighting situation really helps because it limits your color palette to reduce any distraction.  Oh, and it looks like a girl. 8 bump to 9 because I enjoy it so much.', '2009-09-26 11:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663201, 822272, 34192, '<td valign="top">there are other out of focus city shots, but I think this one works.  It has very controlled hues and great work on the tones.  I like the balance of the poles and am glad you included both - they compliment/mimic the corner of the building.  Very well seen and taken. 8</td>', 'there are other out of focus city shots, but I think this one works.  It has very controlled hues and great work on the tones.  I like the balance of the poles and am glad you included both - they compliment/mimic the corner of the building.  Very well seen and taken. 8', '2009-09-26 11:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663202, 822591, 34192, '<td valign="top">title works perfectly - photographer seems in a rush - the reader/subject is not.  Love the limited colors - really forces viewer to focus.  Well toned and good range of tones.  think crop and slant work to add to image. 8</td>', 'title works perfectly - photographer seems in a rush - the reader/subject is not.  Love the limited colors - really forces viewer to focus.  Well toned and good range of tones.  think crop and slant work to add to image. 8', '2009-09-26 11:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663203, 822480, 34192, '<td valign="top">This reminds me so much of the painting "Christina''s World."  I honestly think the title does nothing for setting a mood and, since it draws my attention to the IN FOCUS barley, pushes the image away from meeting the challenge.  I think you captured this beautifully and, with a good title, could have meaning beyond a simple farm crop.  You might possibly crop a large portion of sky.  It would really push forth a feeling of entrapment of the house and give this image a whole different emotional impact.  Well taken 8</td>', 'This reminds me so much of the painting "Christina''s World."  I honestly think the title does nothing for setting a mood and, since it draws my attention to the IN FOCUS barley, pushes the image away from meeting the challenge.  I think you captured this beautifully and, with a good title, could have meaning beyond a simple farm crop.  You might possibly crop a large portion of sky.  It would really push forth a feeling of entrapment of the house and give this image a whole different emotional impact.  Well taken 8', '2009-09-26 11:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663204, 821866, 34192, '<td valign="top">So many stories.  And I wonder at the old lady, if she is falling to throwing, but it doesn''t matter.  Tones well handled.  Thank you for the monochrome!  Well done! 8</td>', 'So many stories.  And I wonder at the old lady, if she is falling to throwing, but it doesn''t matter.  Tones well handled.  Thank you for the monochrome!  Well done! 8', '2009-09-26 11:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663205, 822684, 34192, '<td valign="top">this made me giggle.  Sorry!  Fits missed focus, fits compelling.  Interesting textures and good color pallet to boot. 8</td>', 'this made me giggle.  Sorry!  Fits missed focus, fits compelling.  Interesting textures and good color pallet to boot. 8', '2009-09-26 11:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663206, 822519, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this, though it doesn''t feel like missed focus, rather like unfocused.  The colors really push the mood - just wish there were a few more darks to balance the lights.  Overall well done and fits the challenge, though I think there is opportunity to go further. 7</td>', 'I like this, though it doesn''t feel like missed focus, rather like unfocused.  The colors really push the mood - just wish there were a few more darks to balance the lights.  Overall well done and fits the challenge, though I think there is opportunity to go further. 7', '2009-09-26 11:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663207, 822545, 34192, '<td valign="top">I hate the title - its condescending.  I think you did well with the image, just enough out of focus to get past the voters.  The timing was excellent and the lighting really enhances the subject.  To me, rather boring, but well done for challenge. 7 bump to 8</td>', 'I hate the title - its condescending.  I think you did well with the image, just enough out of focus to get past the voters.  The timing was excellent and the lighting really enhances the subject.  To me, rather boring, but well done for challenge. 7 bump to 8', '2009-09-26 11:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663208, 822580, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Its a cliche shot but with a twist, one that works very well.  I like the touches of red - they really force the focus of the viewer in a monochromatic world, which gives the image a little more depth.  Fits the challenge. good capture. 7 bump to 9</td>', 'I like this.  Its a cliche shot but with a twist, one that works very well.  I like the touches of red - they really force the focus of the viewer in a monochromatic world, which gives the image a little more depth.  Fits the challenge. good capture. 7 bump to 9', '2009-09-26 11:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663209, 822679, 34192, '<td valign="top">Your title is a contradiction to the aim of the challenge - it seems you didn''t expect to focus on the bird as the bird shouldn''t be there; your goal was to focus on the grass, which you did.  I will ignore the title.  I really like the blue contrasting with the gold - its like a vibrant peace.  The bird, even out of focus, lends more movement to an already ''moving'' image. I like that.  Interesting piece.  7</td>', 'Your title is a contradiction to the aim of the challenge - it seems you didn''t expect to focus on the bird as the bird shouldn''t be there; your goal was to focus on the grass, which you did.  I will ignore the title.  I really like the blue contrasting with the gold - its like a vibrant peace.  The bird, even out of focus, lends more movement to an already ''moving'' image. I like that.  Interesting piece.  7', '2009-09-26 11:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663210, 821933, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think your title works well to direct attention away from the bird.  While the subject isn''t compelling to me, I can see how it would be for others. 7</td>', 'I think your title works well to direct attention away from the bird.  While the subject isn''t compelling to me, I can see how it would be for others. 7', '2009-09-26 11:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663211, 822333, 34192, '<td valign="top">great use of subject and photographer movement.  I love the hues you used - limiting the color palette really forces viewer to pay attention to the subject.  Very well toned and good work with your lights and darks.  Only nit I have is the heads all being turned away.  If one was looking at the camera, even blurry, it would really grab attention.  Right now it is just interesting in passing, just as they are. 7</td>', 'great use of subject and photographer movement.  I love the hues you used - limiting the color palette really forces viewer to pay attention to the subject.  Very well toned and good work with your lights and darks.  Only nit I have is the heads all being turned away.  If one was looking at the camera, even blurry, it would really grab attention.  Right now it is just interesting in passing, just as they are. 7', '2009-09-26 11:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663212, 821898, 34192, '<td valign="top">I find this interesting and fairly well balanced for an abstract.  The stark blackness at the top corner bugs me as it doesn''t match any of the other blackness, but it does help control the image. Good snipets of color. 7</td>', 'I find this interesting and fairly well balanced for an abstract.  The stark blackness at the top corner bugs me as it doesn''t match any of the other blackness, but it does help control the image. Good snipets of color. 7', '2009-09-26 11:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663213, 822612, 34192, '<td valign="top">so little here not sure if focus even matters.  wish lights and darks were a little better treated. But a good entry non-the-less. 7</td>', 'so little here not sure if focus even matters.  wish lights and darks were a little better treated. But a good entry non-the-less. 7', '2009-09-26 11:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663214, 822051, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. looks like the cow is standing in front of a backdrop.  And, because of the black cow behind the white cow, who appears as the white cows shadow, it looks like an overly powerful flash was used.  I''m not sure if that was your intention but I''m going to pretend it is and give you a 6 for the ''tongue-in cheek'' humor.</td>', 'Hmmm. looks like the cow is standing in front of a backdrop.  And, because of the black cow behind the white cow, who appears as the white cows shadow, it looks like an overly powerful flash was used.  I''m not sure if that was your intention but I''m going to pretend it is and give you a 6 for the ''tongue-in cheek'' humor.', '2009-09-26 11:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663215, 822274, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like your use of stark tones to set a mood.  Wonder at the title - too late for what?  Why is her eyebrow in focus - what does it mean?  Unanswered questions and I feel this works for the challenge well enough. 6</td>', 'I like your use of stark tones to set a mood.  Wonder at the title - too late for what?  Why is her eyebrow in focus - what does it mean?  Unanswered questions and I feel this works for the challenge well enough. 6', '2009-09-26 11:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663216, 822553, 34192, '<td valign="top">Kind of interesting abstract graphic.  One is out of focus and the fact that the others are in focus draws my attention to this one.  So it fits the challenge, but does it do anything beyond that?  6</td>', 'Kind of interesting abstract graphic.  One is out of focus and the fact that the others are in focus draws my attention to this one.  So it fits the challenge, but does it do anything beyond that?  6', '2009-09-26 11:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663217, 822474, 34192, '<td valign="top">No beach.  I like the shapes and the colors but the image is cut in half horizontally.  Inclusion of the flying bird adds nothing but boring sky.  This could be two images - cut the top and the left and the bird and cabanas really control the image.  Or, cut the bottom and the landscape opens up.  Now the image doesn''t seem to do either very well.  6</td>', 'No beach.  I like the shapes and the colors but the image is cut in half horizontally.  Inclusion of the flying bird adds nothing but boring sky.  This could be two images - cut the top and the left and the bird and cabanas really control the image.  Or, cut the bottom and the landscape opens up.  Now the image doesn''t seem to do either very well.  6', '2009-09-26 11:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663218, 822593, 34192, '<td valign="top">Because the hand is so centered, in-your-face, and in focus, I would think it was the subject.  So, for me, it is not a case of missed focus and doesn''t really relate to the challenge.  However, I do find this a strong image as it is, and like the presentation, though I''m not fond of the title. 6</td>', 'Because the hand is so centered, in-your-face, and in focus, I would think it was the subject.  So, for me, it is not a case of missed focus and doesn''t really relate to the challenge.  However, I do find this a strong image as it is, and like the presentation, though I''m not fond of the title. 6', '2009-09-26 11:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663365, 822603, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the image and think the blur works well to enhance the subject.  I am a little put off by your title, though - the addition of the parenthetical statement is pointless.</td>', 'I like the image and think the blur works well to enhance the subject.  I am a little put off by your title, though - the addition of the parenthetical statement is pointless.', '2009-09-26 15:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
