(5663367, 822652, 34192, '<td valign="top">I wish the lighting had come from the front rather than the rear in this image, if only to enhance the shape of the chick.  Works well for challenge - adds a bit of emotion to the image. 6</td>', 'I wish the lighting had come from the front rather than the rear in this image, if only to enhance the shape of the chick.  Works well for challenge - adds a bit of emotion to the image. 6', '2009-09-26 15:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
