(5664004, 821866, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming maybe this is a lensbaby shot?  This is one of the best ones because you used the blur to create a story.  And it''s obvious that your focus missed the more interesting scene.  I''d love to know what he or she is reaching down to grab.  Is it a bag, or a bottle?  Or is she reaching down for an animal?  Great catch. 8</td>', 'I''m assuming maybe this is a lensbaby shot?  This is one of the best ones because you used the blur to create a story.  And it''s obvious that your focus missed the more interesting scene.  I''d love to know what he or she is reaching down to grab.  Is it a bag, or a bottle?  Or is she reaching down for an animal?  Great catch. 8', '2009-09-27 10:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664005, 822468, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the swirl and also that your intended subject is still out of focus. 8</td>', 'I love the swirl and also that your intended subject is still out of focus. 8', '2009-09-27 10:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664006, 822697, 67697, '<td valign="top">heh - I totally understand this.  Missing the kids face has happened one too many times to me.  They are just so darn fast!  7</td>', 'heh - I totally understand this.  Missing the kids face has happened one too many times to me.  They are just so darn fast!  7', '2009-09-27 10:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664008, 821527, 67697, '<td valign="top">Truly a fitting title!  Good idea for the challenge. 7</td>', 'Truly a fitting title!  Good idea for the challenge. 7', '2009-09-27 10:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664010, 822478, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m really not a big fan of scenes like this.  There''s already so much despair in the world and to see reminders of it here is a bummer.  However, photographically I think this set up is quite fitting.  It''s one where someone wants to record this moment and so obviously, nothing is going to be in focus. 8</td>', 'I''m really not a big fan of scenes like this.  There''s already so much despair in the world and to see reminders of it here is a bummer.  However, photographically I think this set up is quite fitting.  It''s one where someone wants to record this moment and so obviously, nothing is going to be in focus. 8', '2009-09-27 11:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664013, 822455, 67697, '<td valign="top">In this challenge I was looking for something in focus to act as a counterbalance to what might have been in focus instead.  So for the ones totally out of focus, I''m looking for an intriguing scene.  I think this one falls into the intriguing category because I had to stop and look for a bit to see what was going on.  I think the bright colored shirt really captures my attention and then makes me check out everything else. 7</td>', 'In this challenge I was looking for something in focus to act as a counterbalance to what might have been in focus instead.  So for the ones totally out of focus, I''m looking for an intriguing scene.  I think this one falls into the intriguing category because I had to stop and look for a bit to see what was going on.  I think the bright colored shirt really captures my attention and then makes me check out everything else. 7', '2009-09-27 11:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
