(5664040, 822542, 67697, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t fit into my definition of a missed focus.  I see a great DOF shot with the frog in fairly good focus.  And the color pops out so well too. 6</td>', 'This doesn''t fit into my definition of a missed focus.  I see a great DOF shot with the frog in fairly good focus.  And the color pops out so well too. 6', '2009-09-27 11:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664043, 822692, 67697, '<td valign="top">In this challenge I was looking for something in focus to act as a counterbalance to what might have been in focus instead.  So for the ones totally out of focus, I''m looking for an intriguing scene.  Here, I just see something OOF with nothing else to capture my attention.  It doesn''t make me think much beyond what I see here.  6</td>', 'In this challenge I was looking for something in focus to act as a counterbalance to what might have been in focus instead.  So for the ones totally out of focus, I''m looking for an intriguing scene.  Here, I just see something OOF with nothing else to capture my attention.  It doesn''t make me think much beyond what I see here.  6', '2009-09-27 11:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664047, 822637, 67697, '<td valign="top">In this challenge I was looking for something in focus to act as a counterbalance to what might have been in focus instead.  So for the ones totally out of focus, I''m looking for an intriguing scene.  This just makes me think of photos that I have taken, where I tried to get a macro shot and just got too close lol.  For this scene, there isn''t much capturing my attention except for the color. 5</td>', 'In this challenge I was looking for something in focus to act as a counterbalance to what might have been in focus instead.  So for the ones totally out of focus, I''m looking for an intriguing scene.  This just makes me think of photos that I have taken, where I tried to get a macro shot and just got too close lol.  For this scene, there isn''t much capturing my attention except for the color. 5', '2009-09-27 11:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664054, 821881, 67697, '<td valign="top">In this challenge I was looking for something in focus to act as a counterbalance to what might have been in focus instead. This is a really cool long exposure shot but it gives me no indication of what an intended subject might have been.  The only thing I can see that might have been cool is the shadow of the horse in the reflective mirror.  I think I''d like to have seen a tighter crop to give that more emphasis. 6</td>', 'In this challenge I was looking for something in focus to act as a counterbalance to what might have been in focus instead. This is a really cool long exposure shot but it gives me no indication of what an intended subject might have been.  The only thing I can see that might have been cool is the shadow of the horse in the reflective mirror.  I think I''d like to have seen a tighter crop to give that more emphasis. 6', '2009-09-27 11:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664057, 822532, 67697, '<td valign="top">In this challenge I was looking for something in focus to act as a counterbalance to what might have been in focus instead.  So for the ones totally out of focus, I''m looking for an intriguing scene.  I see one here as I feel the Canadian Geese are always good for an interesting shot.  The glow spots are odd tho.  6</td>', 'In this challenge I was looking for something in focus to act as a counterbalance to what might have been in focus instead.  So for the ones totally out of focus, I''m looking for an intriguing scene.  I see one here as I feel the Canadian Geese are always good for an interesting shot.  The glow spots are odd tho.  6', '2009-09-27 11:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664059, 822182, 67697, '<td valign="top">What is the red in the mouth?  I don''t feel this fits the theme of a missed focus.  This seems to be more of a great DOF shot since the dog in the foreground is in focus.  I really can''t tell what was "missed"?  6</td>', 'What is the red in the mouth?  I don''t feel this fits the theme of a missed focus.  This seems to be more of a great DOF shot since the dog in the foreground is in focus.  I really can''t tell what was "missed"?  6', '2009-09-27 12:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
