(5664710, 821866, 62357, '<td valign="top">I sort of figured this maybe yours, the urban scene seemed to fit in well with your style.  I also happened to be one of your 10s.  This one worked very well for me.  And glad to see you got some Don bling :)</td>', 'I sort of figured this maybe yours, the urban scene seemed to fit in well with your style.  I also happened to be one of your 10s.  This one worked very well for me.  And glad to see you got some Don bling :)', '2009-09-28 04:07:46.000000', NULL, 0),
