(5664737, 822688, 30982, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> this image gives me the sensation of being at a Slayer concert when all of a sudden the electricity goes out... silence fills the air... but what''s that? Chopin, on the piano, playing from a distant battery-operated radio, through a gentle white noise of static.<br/> <br/>You get a Posthumous Blur Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/blurpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/blurpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/blurpost.jpg"/>. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Best comment I''ve read in awhile and truly fits the shot.  Congrats!</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: this image gives me the sensation of being at a Slayer concert when all of a sudden the electricity goes out... silence fills the air... but what''s that? Chopin, on the piano, playing from a distant battery-operated radio, through a gentle white noise of static. You get a Posthumous Blur Ribbon .  Best comment I''ve read in awhile and truly fits the shot.  Congrats!', '2009-09-28 05:02:01.000000', NULL, 0),
